  "mergeInstructions": [
    "Merge mechanicDefinitions by id into the matching base.",
    "Register handlers and events centrally; no eval and no implicit handler implementation.",
    "Persist mutable instance and knowledge state separately from definitions.",
    "Implement and validate planned handlers before marking a dependent mission ready.",
    "Capability checks remain mandatory even when requiresCapabilities is empty in this contract plan."
